        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository eb9793fd-4f4a-4181-aca9-b304beed659e).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47!\r\rToday you are heading to sunny Argentina, where Don Yates is looking for help. One of his original wines has been tampered with to destroy upcoming tastings. Save his reputation by making the testers disappear and solving the internal problems in his wine production!\r\r\rGood Luck\r\rIntel:\rTommy Hamilton and Deangelo Cote are the two wine testers and will roam  around the party area while the other two targets are located deeper into the private areas of the estate.",
